            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "We used two main data sources for our project. First, we used the sales data from our partner company to capture the effect of our interventions. This information includes the date, store ID, sales representative ID, date of the transaction, product ID, number of individual units purchased and their monetary value. It covers the period from 14 weeks before and up to 14 weeks after the implementation of the experiment. Second, we incorporate store visit information in the post period, which is captured via GPS tracks by the partner company."
